<%= render "settings/form_errors", record: professional %>

<%= form_with model: [ :settings, professional ] do |form| %>
  <div class="bg-base-100 rounded-box border border-base-300 shadow-sm">
    <div class="divide-y divide-base-300">
      <section class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 p-6">
        <div>
          <h2 class="font-semibold text-base-content">Identificação</h2>
          <p class="text-sm text-base-content/60 mt-1">Nome, cargo e registro saem no quadro de Equipe Técnica da proposta.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="md:col-span-2 grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-x-4">
          <fieldset class="fieldset sm:col-span-2">
            <legend class="fieldset-legend">Nome</legend>
            <%= form.text_field :name, class: settings_field_class(professional, :name), placeholder: "Nome completo", required: true, autofocus: professional.new_record? %>
            <%= settings_field_error(professional, :name) %>
          </fieldset>

          <fieldset class="fieldset">
            <legend class="fieldset-legend">Cargo / formação</legend>
            <%= form.text_field :role, class: settings_field_class(professional, :role), placeholder: "Ex.: Bióloga", required: true %>
            <%= settings_field_error(professional, :role) %>
          </fieldset>

          <fieldset class="fieldset">
            <legend class="fieldset-legend">Registro profissional <span class="font-normal text-base-content/50">(opcional)</span></legend>
            <%= form.text_field :registration, class: settings_field_class(professional, :registration), placeholder: "Ex.: CRBio 54321" %>
          </fieldset>

          <fieldset class="fieldset sm:col-span-2">
            <legend class="fieldset-legend">Habilitação / especialidades</legend>
            <%= form.text_area :specialties, rows: 3, class: settings_field_class(professional, :specialties, base: "textarea"),
                  placeholder: "Ex.: Mestre em Ecologia. Especialista em fauna silvestre." %>
            <p class="label whitespace-normal">Formação completa — sai na coluna HABILITAÇÃO / REGISTRO e ajuda a IA a escolher quem entra na equipe.</p>
          </fieldset>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 p-6">
        <div>
          <h2 class="font-semibold text-base-content">Valores</h2>
          <p class="text-sm text-base-content/60 mt-1">Base do motor de precificação: horas-homem × valor da hora + diárias × valor da diária.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="md:col-span-2 grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-x-4">
          <fieldset class="fieldset">
            <legend class="fieldset-legend">Valor da hora-homem</legend>
            <label class="<%= settings_field_class(professional, :rate_man_hour) %>">
              <span class="text-base-content/50">R$</span>
              <%= form.number_field :rate_man_hour, step: "any", min: 0, required: true, class: "grow" %>
              <span class="text-xs text-base-content/40">/ hora</span>
            </label>
            <%= settings_field_error(professional, :rate_man_hour) %>
          </fieldset>

          <fieldset class="fieldset">
            <legend class="fieldset-legend">Valor da diária</legend>
            <label class="<%= settings_field_class(professional, :rate_daily) %>">
              <span class="text-base-content/50">R$</span>
              <%= form.number_field :rate_daily, step: "any", min: 0, required: true, class: "grow" %>
              <span class="text-xs text-base-content/40">/ dia</span>
            </label>
            <%= settings_field_error(professional, :rate_daily) %>
          </fieldset>

          <fieldset class="fieldset">
            <legend class="fieldset-legend">Encargos sociais (opcional)</legend>
            <label class="<%= settings_field_class(professional, :social_charges_percent) %>">
              <%= form.number_field :social_charges_percent_display, step: "any", min: 0, class: "grow" %>
              <span class="text-xs text-base-content/40">% do salário</span>
            </label>
            <p class="text-xs text-base-content/50">Quanto dos valores acima é encargo. Só é usado quando a planilha do cliente pede salário e encargos separados; em branco, o valor vai cheio.</p>
          </fieldset>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 p-6">
        <div>
          <h2 class="font-semibold text-base-content">Participação</h2>
          <p class="text-sm text-base-content/60 mt-1">Como este profissional entra nas propostas.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="md:col-span-2 flex flex-col gap-3">
          <label class="flex items-start gap-3 p-4 rounded-box border border-base-300 cursor-pointer transition-colors hover:border-primary/40 has-[:checked]:border-primary/40 has-[:checked]:bg-primary/5">
            <%= form.check_box :active, class: "toggle toggle-primary toggle-sm mt-0.5" %>
            <span>
              <span class="block text-sm font-medium text-base-content">Ativo</span>
              <span class="block text-xs text-base-content/60 mt-0.5">Aparece para a IA ao montar a equipe e na busca da Tela de Precificação. Desative em vez de excluir quem já participou de propostas.</span>
            </span>
          </label>

          <label class="flex items-start gap-3 p-4 rounded-box border border-base-300 cursor-pointer transition-colors hover:border-primary/40 has-[:checked]:border-primary/40 has-[:checked]:bg-primary/5">
            <%= form.check_box :always_included, class: "toggle toggle-primary toggle-sm mt-0.5" %>
            <span>
              <span class="block text-sm font-medium text-base-content">Sempre incluir na equipe</span>
              <span class="block text-xs text-base-content/60 mt-0.5">Diretoria/Coordenação — entra em toda proposta, independente do que a IA sugerir.</span>
            </span>
          </label>

          <label class="flex items-start gap-3 p-4 rounded-box border border-base-300 cursor-pointer transition-colors hover:border-primary/40 has-[:checked]:border-primary/40 has-[:checked]:bg-primary/5">
            <%= form.check_box :cost_in_bdi, class: "toggle toggle-primary toggle-sm mt-0.5" %>
            <span>
              <span class="block text-sm font-medium text-base-content">Custo incluso no BDI</span>
              <span class="block text-xs text-base-content/60 mt-0.5">Entra na equipe e no quadro da proposta, mas sem hora-homem nem diária — o custo já está no BDI. Os valores acima são ignorados.</span>
            </span>
          </label>

          <label class="flex items-start gap-3 p-4 rounded-box border border-base-300 cursor-pointer transition-colors hover:border-primary/40 has-[:checked]:border-primary/40 has-[:checked]:bg-primary/5">
            <%= form.check_box :technical_team, class: "toggle toggle-primary toggle-sm mt-0.5" %>
            <span>
              <span class="block text-sm font-medium text-base-content">Aparece no quadro de equipe técnica</span>
              <span class="block text-xs text-base-content/60 mt-0.5">Desmarque pra apoio (administrativo, revisão, formatação): continua na precificação, mas não sai no quadro de equipe da proposta.</span>
            </span>
          </label>
        </div>
      </section>
    </div>

    <%= render "settings/form_actions", form: form, cancel_path: settings_professionals_path,
          submit_label: professional.new_record? ? "Cadastrar profissional" : "Salvar alterações" %>
  </div>
<% end %>
